<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">J</span>ust-in-time <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">E</span>pisodic <span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">F</span>eedback <span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">H</span>inter: Leveraging Offline Knowledge to Improve LLM Agents Adaptation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Hadi Nekoei  Aman Jaiswal  Patrice Bechard  Oleh Shliazhko  Orlando Marquez Ayala
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>ServiceNow Research
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Mila – Quebec AI Institute
</span>
