</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><span id="id5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Mathieu Reymond</span>  <span id="id6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Massimo Caccia</span>  <span id="id7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Alexandre Drouin</span>  <span id="id8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sarath Chandar</span>  <span id="id9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Alexandre Lacoste</span>
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>ServiceNow Research
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Mila – Quebec AI Institute
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Université de Montréal
</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Polytechnique Montréal
